  "qualificationScope": "Mac signed F2 built G1=G2=G3 from the current 18-module core, with byte-identical container and native code. Changes seed/00-ns, seed/21-check and seed/30-lower (JUN-733 slice 2): row operations on records -- assoc of an absent key extends the row, {} is the empty record as assoc / merge's record argument, dissoc / select-keys shrink it, merge takes both records' fields, update is reader sugar for let + assoc; results are the record of their shape by structural identity (keyword rank table MM-CK-KRANK). Programs without these forms are unchanged. Native ARM packed/core, native x86, controller, public aliases, cold C0, performance, release and physical qualification remain separate.",
